+set joined to text.join(["a", "b", "c"], ",")  // "a,b,c"
+set size to text.length("hello")  // 5
 ```
 
+The separator is an ordinary second argument. `by` is the step of a range loop
+and nothing else, so `text.split("a,b,c", by ",")` does not parse.
